          "claim": "Trinkets function as reusable materials, retrieval queries, and navigational anchors during design exploration.",
          "quote": "We introduce trinkets: user-preserved design elements that function as reusable materials, retrieval queries, and navigational anchors for design exploration."
        },
        {
          "claim": "The mechanism prevents designers from losing context as generated outputs proliferate.",
